WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.667
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.583
<i>Between us half-demon twins, </i>
<i> two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.875 --> 00:00:23.375
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.250
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.333
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.583 --> 00:00:29.292
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.375
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.417
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.250
<i>A Feudal Fairytale, </i>
<i> Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.708 --> 00:00:43.458
<i>We'll keep moving forward </i>
<i> through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.083
GREAT DOG-DEMON
BEAST KING KIRINMARU

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:02.875
Blasting Barrage!

00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.292
Meido Zangetsuha!

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:29.667
The Grim Comet is receding.

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:31.500
BEAUTIFUL MYSTERY DEMON – ZERO
This is thanks to both of you.

00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:36.083
It's mostly thanks to Kirinmaru.
I really did not do much.

00:01:36.083 --> 00:01:37.250
You are too modest.

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:40.583
He sleeps so carelessly.

00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:43.333
It's because you're here
to look after him.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:46.917
Flattery will get you nowhere!

00:01:47.417 --> 00:01:51.500
Now then, I shall return
to the Western domain.

00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:53.875
Farewell, Lady Zero.

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:57.333
My Lord.

00:01:57.792 --> 00:02:02.167
Sometimes, I ask myself
how long we must continue this.

00:02:02.167 --> 00:02:03.333
I wonder.

00:02:03.333 --> 00:02:08.750
We are fated to journey an endless path.
Who knows where it will take us?

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:12.875
Do you think we will
have to welcome the end one day?

00:02:13.125 --> 00:02:17.417
No matter where this leads us,
or what sort of end greets us...

00:02:19.375 --> 00:02:23.500
You are who you are, Lady Zero.
I would like for you to remain that way.

00:02:29.417 --> 00:02:31.542
I am who I am, you say...

00:02:35.375 --> 00:02:37.625
I will honor your advice.

00:02:38.917 --> 00:02:40.083
My Lord.

00:04:22.417 --> 00:04:24.167
"The Stolen Seal"

00:04:34.625 --> 00:04:37.125
HISUI'S FATHER – MIROKU

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.708
Admirable of you to brave
the one thousand–day training.

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:50.542
Who might you be?

00:04:55.708 --> 00:04:57.750
My name is Otsuyu.

00:04:57.875 --> 00:05:01.292
I wanted to ask you for directions
toward the right path.

00:05:01.542 --> 00:05:02.667
The right path?

00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:09.208
On meeting an arhat, slay the arhat;
on meeting your parents, slay your parents...

00:05:09.208 --> 00:05:12.875
Know that the light to your path lies there.

00:05:13.542 --> 00:05:17.417
Who are you?
You don't seem to be human.

00:05:19.125 --> 00:05:23.125
You don't seem to have demon powers,
so you're not an apparition, either.

00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:26.250
It may be suitable to call me
a devilish woman.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:31.292
Oh no, I already know what would happen
if I called you that in front of Sango.

00:05:31.458 --> 00:05:34.042
May I ask what your true purpose
is for being here?

00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:36.417
I'll be straightforward, then.

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:40.125
I'd like you to release
the half-demon girl's seal.

00:05:41.083 --> 00:05:43.042
Are you talking about Setsuna?

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.792
And if I said no?

00:05:46.583 --> 00:05:48.167
By force, then.

00:05:49.417 --> 00:05:50.792
You say frightful things.

00:05:51.125 --> 00:05:54.667
Monk, I can so easily
understand your heart.

00:05:54.917 --> 00:05:56.792
Training is only in name.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.625
You still cannot seem
to give up your Wind Tunnel.

00:06:01.917 --> 00:06:03.125
Azusa no Yumihari!

00:06:07.167 --> 00:06:09.625
Th-This is a tsuchigumo's silk!

00:06:10.042 --> 00:06:12.375
I thought you didn't have demon powers.

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:20.958
You are going to lend me the fruits
of your training, the power of the seal.

00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:24.625
Curse my weak-minded self.

00:06:24.625 --> 00:06:27.417
Please don't worry yourself
about such things.

00:06:27.667 --> 00:06:30.583
"Whatever choices we
find ourselves making in life,

00:06:30.583 --> 00:06:33.333
we will never know whether
we end up in Heaven or Hell,"

00:06:33.333 --> 00:06:35.292
as the monks love to say.

00:06:38.833 --> 00:06:41.417
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.875
<i>I wonder what it is I'm feeling...</i>

00:06:46.625 --> 00:06:50.542
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASH<i>I
I don't feel this way when Papa Sota hugs m</i>e.

00:06:53.208 --> 00:06:54.375
Towa.

00:06:54.375 --> 00:06:55.542
Are you okay?

00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:59.292
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:06:59.667 --> 00:07:01.125
What's wrong, you two?

00:07:01.458 --> 00:07:02.625
Moroha.

00:07:03.125 --> 00:07:06.583
Didn't I already give you the share
from Totetsu's bounty?

00:07:06.958 --> 00:07:08.125
It's not that.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:12.792
Mr. Jyubei said he would introduce me
to a good blade sharpener.

00:07:13.042 --> 00:07:14.833
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:16.542
Whaddya need with a blade sharpener?

00:07:18.917 --> 00:07:22.333
I feel like it's lost its edge lately.

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:25.625
I see. So that's how it is.

00:07:25.625 --> 00:07:27.042
– Don't touch it!
– Whoa, there!

00:07:27.833 --> 00:07:31.333
If you're getting it inspected,
you gotta show me properly.

00:07:31.625 --> 00:07:33.125
What do you mean?

00:07:34.958 --> 00:07:39.917
The blade sharpener that Mr. Jyubei
was going to introduce you to is yours truly!

00:07:40.417 --> 00:07:42.625
Moroha, you can sharpen blades, too?

00:07:42.625 --> 00:07:47.292
You bet! You can leave anything
to this jack-of-all-trades!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.792
Where did you get that wound?

00:07:56.292 --> 00:07:57.583
Sister.

00:07:57.583 --> 00:08:00.542
Don't tell me Sesshomaru's
daughters gave that to you?

00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:03.250
Just so.

00:08:03.792 --> 00:08:07.042
But they're still pups
who haven't even fully grown their fangs.

00:08:07.292 --> 00:08:10.750
They could barely entertain me,
let alone fulfill the prophecy.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.292
Oh, really?

00:08:14.958 --> 00:08:16.125
Sister.

00:08:16.125 --> 00:08:19.042
Don't stop me.  I'm only going for a walk.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.292
Please don't get too carried away.

00:08:21.792 --> 00:08:24.167
And you have no regard for my safety?

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.292
We should wait for them
to grow a little more.

00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:31.458
You don't know anything, do you?

00:08:32.167 --> 00:08:35.333
Those girls' powers have been sealed.

00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:39.458
I do know about that.
She's inherited his blood, hasn't she?

00:08:39.792 --> 00:08:44.250
Besides, she was still being led around
by the Dog-Demon's blood,

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.667
and has yet to master it.

00:08:46.667 --> 00:08:49.125
That's the quarter-demon girl.

00:08:49.292 --> 00:08:52.042
I'm talking about the half-demons.

00:08:52.042 --> 00:08:53.042
Oh?

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:58.875
If the seal is released, even you
won't get away with just a scratch.

00:08:59.625 --> 00:09:01.958
I shall go find out during my walk.

00:09:12.458 --> 00:09:13.875
It's not doing so well.

00:09:13.875 --> 00:09:16.583
Hand it back.
I asked the wrong person.

00:09:16.583 --> 00:09:18.250
This is my professional opinion!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:22.958
No one around here
can sharpen a blade better than me.

00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:24.875
Then why isn't it going well?

00:09:25.167 --> 00:09:28.542
How should I know?
The reason might be you, Setsuna.

00:09:28.625 --> 00:09:30.625
Your demon blood has become stronger,

00:09:31.042 --> 00:09:34.292
so the sealed poison
is affecting its sharpness.

00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:38.000
So I need to speak
with Monk Miroku again?

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:42.167
Maybe. So don't go and blame
everything on me.

00:09:42.167 --> 00:09:45.875
No, there's no mistake that
your skills are still not enough.

00:09:46.375 --> 00:09:48.458
Why, you...

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:51.917
– The only thing cute about you is your face!
– Good grief.

00:09:54.667 --> 00:09:55.667
Unbelievable.

00:09:56.083 --> 00:09:59.750
There's no better sharpener than me
in this town.

00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:06.625
Would you like to buy an apple?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:08.917
Who are you?

00:10:08.917 --> 00:10:11.708
My name is Otsuyu.

00:10:11.708 --> 00:10:13.792
– I sell apples.
– Towa!

00:10:13.792 --> 00:10:16.167
What are you doing?
Let's go already.

00:10:16.333 --> 00:10:20.125
I've dried my voice out, so I'm selling apples.

00:10:24.292 --> 00:10:26.000
<i>It's cold. A snow storm?</i>

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.875
<i>You and I are in the same world.</i>

00:10:30.708 --> 00:10:33.583
Now, let's make a pinky promise.

00:10:35.125 --> 00:10:36.750
<i>You did well, Riku.</i>

00:10:37.542 --> 00:10:43.292
<i>Without the Silver Pearl protecting her, </i>
<i> she will easily fall into my trap.</i>

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:46.000
Come on Towa, let's go.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.333
What is she doing?

00:10:48.333 --> 00:10:49.750
Something's not right.

00:10:50.083 --> 00:10:51.542
What's wrong, Towa?

00:10:52.083 --> 00:10:55.667
Oh, Setsuna, sorry I...

00:10:57.292 --> 00:10:58.792
Hey you, get away from Towa.

00:11:06.125 --> 00:11:09.583
<i>What? I've seen those eyes </i>
<i> somewhere before.</i>

00:11:11.375 --> 00:11:12.333
Towa!

00:11:15.375 --> 00:11:18.333
<i>When was the last time </i>
<i>I saw those eyes?</i>

00:11:18.583 --> 00:11:19.542
Towa.

00:11:21.833 --> 00:11:23.083
Are you okay, Towa?

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:25.583
No, I'm not okay.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.500
What are you doing, Towa?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:32.542
I don't know. What am I doing?

00:11:32.708 --> 00:11:35.667
That's it. Keep holding her down.

00:11:37.167 --> 00:11:39.458
– Hey, let go.
– What the hell did you do to Towa?

00:11:39.958 --> 00:11:41.458
Go ahead and draw your sword.

00:11:41.875 --> 00:11:43.583
But if you kill me,

00:11:43.875 --> 00:11:48.333
you will also kill Towa,
who is linked to me.

00:11:51.875 --> 00:11:56.583
<i>Moreover, Towa is not the only one </i>
<i> who is tied to me.</i>

00:11:57.542 --> 00:12:02.708
TOWA AND SETSUNA'S MOTHER – RI<i>N
I wonder... just how many people would die with m</i>e.

00:12:03.208 --> 00:12:04.875
Who the hell are you?

00:12:09.417 --> 00:12:10.250
Could it be...

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.375
Yes, you are correct.

00:12:13.375 --> 00:12:14.417
Let go of me, Towa.

00:12:14.708 --> 00:12:19.083
Rin, Pyo, To, Sha, Kai, Jin, Retsu, Zai, Zen...

00:12:19.292 --> 00:12:20.167
Release!

00:12:24.167 --> 00:12:25.250
Setsuna?

00:12:36.958 --> 00:12:40.125
Now, the seal has been released.

00:12:55.292 --> 00:12:58.542
Now, the seal has been released.

00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:07.167
Delivery items!

00:13:07.375 --> 00:13:08.333
Kin'u?

00:13:08.583 --> 00:13:10.333
HISUI'S OLDER SISTER – KIN'U
What's this, Father?

00:13:10.333 --> 00:13:13.750
HISUI'S OLDER SISTER – KIN'U
You sure are coming up with strange new ways to train.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.667
I know you know what's going on.

00:13:16.667 --> 00:13:17.667
Of course.

00:13:19.208 --> 00:13:21.292
Quit laughing
and help me out of this!

00:13:21.792 --> 00:13:24.458
I don't have much time. Setsuna's...

00:13:24.708 --> 00:13:26.417
Setsuna's in danger.

00:13:33.125 --> 00:13:34.250
<i>I remember.</i>

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.000
<i>When I was a child, those eyes were...</i>

00:13:37.917 --> 00:13:40.833
<i>I've found you, half-demon girls.</i>

00:13:41.625 --> 00:13:46.417
<i>It's those eyes that were </i>
<i>staring at me while I dreamt!</i>

00:13:47.875 --> 00:13:50.875
Everything... It's all her fault!

00:13:50.958 --> 00:13:53.625
You're no ordinary human, are you?

00:13:54.292 --> 00:13:57.250
You're right, I'm no ordinary human.

00:13:57.792 --> 00:13:59.625
Otsuyu is a fake name.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.375
My name is...

00:14:08.917 --> 00:14:11.583
Zero. I am Kirinmaru's older sister.

00:14:11.833 --> 00:14:12.833
Kirinmaru's sister?!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:14.250
But...

00:14:16.917 --> 00:14:17.958
I won't forgive you.

00:14:18.167 --> 00:14:19.250
Setsuna?

00:14:21.583 --> 00:14:25.708
It looks like you can still differentiate
between enemy and ally,

00:14:25.708 --> 00:14:27.750
but it's only a matter of time.

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.708
The seething of blood
will invite demonic frenzy.

00:14:31.417 --> 00:14:32.417
Sever.

00:14:34.667 --> 00:14:35.625
Towa!

00:14:38.958 --> 00:14:40.750
So you've revealed your true form.

00:14:41.667 --> 00:14:43.375
That's what I've been waiting for.

00:14:43.583 --> 00:14:46.125
Eat this!
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:14:47.333 --> 00:14:48.958
Your attack lacks spirit.

00:14:49.875 --> 00:14:50.958
Oh, no.

00:14:51.125 --> 00:14:53.083
Crimson Dragons favor white clouds.

00:14:53.917 --> 00:14:57.000
It will not obey the will
of a novice like you.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.375
Hey, everyone.

00:15:00.583 --> 00:15:02.167
RACCOON DOG DEMON – TAKECHIYO
What's up with you, Setsuna?

00:15:02.458 --> 00:15:04.583
Don't come near me!

00:15:04.583 --> 00:15:05.833
How's this, then?

00:15:06.292 --> 00:15:07.542
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.375
Your spirit power is scattered.

00:15:12.708 --> 00:15:13.667
What?

00:15:15.458 --> 00:15:18.042
Kirinmaru won't be able to
use his true strength.

00:15:18.542 --> 00:15:20.875
You need to redo your training.

00:15:21.417 --> 00:15:22.333
Damn it.

00:15:22.333 --> 00:15:25.167
She got away.
Are you okay, Towa?

00:15:25.167 --> 00:15:28.458
Yeah, sorry. Where's Setsuna?

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:32.625
Help me!

00:15:40.208 --> 00:15:42.167
Are you all right, Takechiyo?

00:15:42.167 --> 00:15:43.750
Oh thank goodness.

00:15:51.917 --> 00:15:55.125
She's just like me when
I've turned into Beniyasha.

00:15:55.375 --> 00:15:56.542
Calm down, Setsuna.

00:16:03.917 --> 00:16:06.125
SESSHOMARU
The flow of wind has changed.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:12.208
She still can't suppress her blood.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:22.083
DEMON SWORDSMITH – TOTOSAI
Oh, looks like the training of the Blood Blade has begun.

00:16:22.958 --> 00:16:24.417
Setsuna, I'm sorry, but...

00:16:24.875 --> 00:16:26.167
Bear with me, okay?

00:16:26.417 --> 00:16:27.875
Are you going to cut her?

00:16:28.292 --> 00:16:32.708
No, I'm going to see if I can
absorb Setsuna's demon powers.

00:16:33.208 --> 00:16:35.417
Got it. I'll back you up.

00:16:35.417 --> 00:16:36.958
Thanks, Moroha.

00:16:45.875 --> 00:16:47.792
<i>There's so much demon power.</i>

00:16:48.792 --> 00:16:52.542
<i>Please Setsuna, </i>
<i> just let me absorb your demon power.</i>

00:17:00.542 --> 00:17:02.208
Wh-What is this?

00:17:02.208 --> 00:17:03.333
Get back, Towa.

00:17:04.875 --> 00:17:05.875
What?

00:17:06.667 --> 00:17:09.125
What's that demon energy?

00:17:10.583 --> 00:17:11.542
Setsuna...

00:17:13.917 --> 00:17:15.250
Wait, Setsuna.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.958
Damn it. I got no choice...

00:17:17.583 --> 00:17:21.375
If I'm going to stop her,
then I need to go all out, too.

00:17:24.042 --> 00:17:25.292
Moroha!

00:17:30.375 --> 00:17:31.917
Get back here, Setsuna.

00:17:49.708 --> 00:17:53.417
That demon energy...
It's just like the Dream Butterfly.

00:17:53.417 --> 00:17:54.292
Towa!

00:17:55.708 --> 00:17:56.792
CAT DEMON – KIRARA
Gyokuto?

00:17:56.792 --> 00:18:01.042
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU – HISUI
Oh, I'm Kin'u, Gyokuto's older sister.

00:18:01.042 --> 00:18:02.125
Where's Setsuna?

00:18:02.125 --> 00:18:07.208
Over there, fighting with Moroha.
But I think Moroha's almost at her limit.

00:18:07.208 --> 00:18:10.583
So what Father predicted
has become true.

00:18:11.125 --> 00:18:13.250
Sister, can you really do it?

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:17.792
I have to, don't I? Besides,
I'm pretty confident in my sealing powers.

00:18:18.167 --> 00:18:21.792
The problem is, I don't think I can
stop her from moving around.

00:18:22.125 --> 00:18:23.542
Stop her from moving?

00:18:24.042 --> 00:18:25.750
This is what I heard from Father.

00:18:26.417 --> 00:18:31.375
The last time this happened,
someone named Shiori held her down

00:18:31.375 --> 00:18:33.333
and managed to calm her.

00:18:33.792 --> 00:18:36.083
I've heard about that, too.

00:18:37.125 --> 00:18:39.833
I'll be the one to help calm her down.

00:18:39.833 --> 00:18:43.042
Kin'u, please focus on Setsuna's seal.

00:18:43.042 --> 00:18:44.250
Are you sure?

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.792
Yes! I am Setsuna's older sister after all.

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:48.250
Let's go, Takechiyo.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:49.458
Fine...

00:18:50.833 --> 00:18:54.333
That's some bravery.
Unlike this one older sister I know.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.542
Shut up! How dare you, Hisui!

00:19:15.208 --> 00:19:17.750
<i>Setsuna's way too strong.</i>

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:29.958
Setsuna!

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:37.083
Setsuna, calm down. Please!

00:19:43.625 --> 00:19:47.292
It's me, Setsuna! It's Towa!

00:19:48.500 --> 00:19:51.625
Get it together, Setsuna!

00:19:55.208 --> 00:19:56.417
<i>I can hear her.</i>

00:19:57.417 --> 00:19:58.750
<i>Towa's voice.</i>

00:19:59.583 --> 00:20:01.083
<i>Towa's calling to me.</i>

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.417
<i>I can hear her!</i>

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:06.833
Setsuna, please hear me.

00:20:07.542 --> 00:20:09.375
I'm right here, Setsuna!

00:20:09.375 --> 00:20:15.333
I'm here...
Your older sister is right here!

00:20:32.958 --> 00:20:34.333
Towa, Setsuna.

00:20:34.917 --> 00:20:36.583
Sister, please.

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:44.208
On meeting an arhat, slay the arhat;
on meeting your parents, slay your parents...

00:20:44.708 --> 00:20:47.875
Know that the light to your path lies there.

00:20:52.708 --> 00:20:55.667
Sister, that cluster of blood
didn't disappear.

00:20:55.667 --> 00:20:58.125
Well, that's strange.

00:20:59.583 --> 00:21:00.958
Setsuna!

00:21:01.792 --> 00:21:02.667
Towa.

00:21:02.917 --> 00:21:06.000
I'm so glad you're back to normal.

00:21:07.417 --> 00:21:10.375
No, I don't think I am, unfortunately.

00:21:11.292 --> 00:21:13.667
I can still feel the blood seething.

00:21:13.917 --> 00:21:15.250
Setsuna.

00:21:15.458 --> 00:21:18.125
I owe that woman a large debt.

00:21:18.625 --> 00:21:20.875
I'll have to pay her back a hundredfold.

00:21:30.625 --> 00:21:36.625
This is who I am after all.
That's fine, isn't it, My Lord?

00:21:37.667 --> 00:21:42.833
All that remains are the finishing touches
for the other half-demon girl.

00:21:52.792 --> 00:21:55.792
It's come awfully close now.

00:21:56.458 --> 00:21:59.333
TOWA'S TEACHER – OSAMU KIRIN
So the Grim Comet does appear,

00:21:59.333 --> 00:22:01.083
even in this era.

00:22:05.667 --> 00:22:06.917
Isn't that...

00:22:09.125 --> 00:22:12.167
Well, well, Mr. Higurashi, is that you?

00:23:43.083 --> 00:23:44.958
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.958 --> 00:23:49.667
We find Zero using remnants of her
Azusa no Yumihari, but Riku stands in our way.

00:23:49.667 --> 00:23:51.667
Would you honor me with a fight?

00:23:51.667 --> 00:23:54.333
I have your life now! Prepare yourself!

00:23:54.333 --> 00:23:58.708
Attempting revenge so soon?
I like you, Half-Demon Princesses!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.208
Why did we inherit
the powers in our blood?

00:24:01.208 --> 00:24:03.917
I can find the answer in this battle!

00:24:04.083 --> 00:24:07.083
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"The Three Princesses Strike Back"

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:23.936
You will regret underestimating me, Zero!
